  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Causes and situation",
     "texto": [
      "**Fluktårsak** describes why someone has to leave their home. An **asylsøker** is a person who applies for asylum and waits for their application for protection to be processed.",
      "**Labour migration** and **family migration** are different reasons for moving to another country."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "A nuanced description",
     "texto": [
      "An **oppholdstillatelse** is a residence permit subject to certain conditions. **Temporary protection** does not necessarily imply permanent residence."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
